# EcoTekk currently needs NO secret environment variables: it is a static site and the AI key is held by
# Firebase AI Logic, not by this repo. This file exists so that if you ever add a server script
# (for example an admin tool using the Firebase Admin SDK), the real values go in a git-ignored .env,
# never in the code.
#
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=./secrets/service-account.json
